gbmRUccB4NLDNAS0eNdQxXO25lr3UhOQ&oe=69F1F175"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "2078471315650549", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974466_2078471318983882_98333641966260853_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MdytGmujgl8Q7kNvwGh6JiT&_nc_oc=AdodwYYktVTDtjEjZIkZ8vZIy7Qd9VQYjlZOUMfxo9iB24Wp4PSXD94jNlg_VMLNILU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0UPDuRszcZDsxr3pYvUSZudzwc6YtmhwhvD7X3VTBRHw&oe=69F21ACF"}, "display_name": "Blockies VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Blockies VR is a single player action-puzzle game where you knock down block buildings and protect friendly Blockies against the forces of evil. Launch a wide range of objects at enemies in this low-poly physics world. Travel to the Kingdom\u2019s shop to expand your weapon arsenal to take on the most difficult puzzles in all the land.\n\nFeatures\n-A dozen types of blocks that interact uniquely with the world\n-A dozen AI enemy types each with their own abilities\n-Levels where you must defend the Blockies from monster attacks\n-Levels with intricate block puzzles to solve\n-The Kingdom where cool new projectiles can be purchased\n-Beautifully designed low poly environments\n-At least 50 levels by full release (Currently 16)\n-With enough support: Level Editor to create and share new levels\n-With enough support: Co-op and Multiplayer Functionality\n\nJoin the Discord to learn more about future updates, and provide your own feedback of what you want in the game!", "short_description": "Blockies VR is a fast-paced, action-puzzle game where you throw projectiles. Destroy block buildings and defend friendly Blockies! Fight against all kinds of enemy monsters by throwing projectiles ranging from a silly pineapple to a destructive blackhole."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://dragongatestudio.net/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null,